OL,3,GNEWSATeen who 'made terrorism
OL,4,Amanifesto' admits charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who wrote his own terrorism
OL,7,Fmanifesto and is accused of stirring up
OL,8,Fracial hatred against Jewish people and
OL,9,Fforeigners has pleaded guilty to 12
OL,10,Fterrorism offences.
OL,12,FDamien Woolfenden, 18, formerly of
OL,13,FBury, admitted posting Christchurch
OL,14,Fattacker Brenton Tarrant's
OL,15,Flive-streamed video of the 2019
OL,16,Fkillings on to the self-described
OL,17,F"pro-white" platform White Pilled TV.
OL,19,FHe also posted the manifesto of
OL,20,Ffar-right terrorist Andres Breivik, who
OL,21,Fkilled 77 people in two attacks in
OL,22,FNorway in 2011, on to a Telegram group.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
