OL,4,Amanifesto' admits charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FWoolfenden pleaded guilty to other
OL,7,Fcharges of disseminating terrorist
OL,8,Fmaterial, as well as possessing
OL,9,Fpublications useful for terrorism,
OL,10,Fincluding the Anarchist's Cookbook.
